# FRESH2 report (test part), written by training/sketch/fresh2/fit_report.mjs

Records: results/064_arm_bert_T/records. Messages: 600 in the data dirs (opus_a, opus_b, opus_c, opus_d); calibration 195 messages / 596 requested actions; test 405 messages / 1313 requested actions.
Split: int(sha256(id), 16) % 3 == 0 is calibration. Thresholds and confidences are fitted on the calibration part only. MINEXEC 50; bootstrap 1000 resamples of the test messages, seed 1.
Definitions (per requested action, PAIR=value as llm_score.mjs): confidently wrong % = (executed wrong + executed extras) / everything executed; done right % = executed right / requested actions; asked % = right or wrong requests below the threshold / requested; not read % = requested actions with n

